jt-pve-storage-synology (0.2.2~beta1-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Fix stray spaces inside every Traditional Chinese sentence: GitHub renders a
    soft line break between two Chinese characters as a visible space. All four
    documents unwrapped, and make check-zh now fails on it, on italic emphasis,
    and on a space after full-width punctuation.
  * Synology::Command, ported almost unchanged from the Dell EMC project:
    bounded commands, bounded file tests, bounded sysfs.
  * Synology::Multipath: the mandatory conf.d drop-in, dm-uuid addressing,
    one-map operations, kernel-confirmed device identity.

